{"sourceUrl":"http://art.swust.edu.cn/#/display/2123","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:55.176186+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://its.swust.edu.cn/2025/0629/c11769a219369/page.htm#/display/2123","html":"<div><p><span>客户端、学术资源访问使用说明<br/></span><br/></p><p><span>第一部分：客户端使用说明</span><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong><span>一、</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>PC</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>端（个人电脑）</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>请在浏览器地址栏输入</span><span>https://atrust.swust.edu.cn</span><span>并登录。不同浏览器中若出现下图，请点击“高级”后，再点击继续访问”进入下载页面。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/15d4ed70-6eb5-4d7f-94ce-52fce7df60a2.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/adad046c-aba4-4614-a759-0a57d738efb5.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>2.</span><span>下载适合本机的客户端后进行安装。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/9993c0da-a862-43d1-9920-5ea9f99bd2b2.png\"/></p><p><span>3.</span><span>安装完成，运行软件。“接入设置”中填写<strong><span>https://atrust.swust.edu.cn</span></strong>后，请使用钉钉扫码认证待组件安装完成后，请重启电脑。（过程中若有下图窗口出现，可以直接关闭）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/d2d14eef-ce5b-4c8b-b7b2-4d878c16e50b.jpg\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/2ce4c8c8-82fc-4104-bb98-81bb002a46fd.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>4.</span><span>双击开启已经安装好的“办公安全助手”，钉钉扫码认证后登录即开启</span><span>VPN</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/9b763310-3bac-447f-a5bb-409fa752de6c.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/71b0e7b3-e79a-4f37-82e4-f341fac8cc1d.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><strong><span>温馨提示：</span></strong></span><span>开启“校园内网”模式后，只能访问校内信息系统；若需访问校外网站可选择开启“互联网”模式。</span></span></span></p><p><span>如果使用“校园内网”无法访问校园网业务，请关闭当前计算机网络</span><span>IPv6</span><span>协议。（视频说明如下）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><div></div></span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/c2b60162-17c5-48d7-8567-e371397b313c.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong><span>二、移动端</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>（一）安卓版：</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>请从手机应用市场下载并安装“</span><span>aTrust”</span><span>客户端，运行后点击“同意并继续”。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>请在地址栏请输入：</span><span>https://atrust.swust.edu.cn</span><span>后点击“连接”。若无法连接服务器，请打开手机飞行模式，等待</span><span>3</span><span>秒，再关闭飞行模式后，尝试再次连接。如果仍然失败，可以多次尝试以上操作。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/ceae3851-a2f1-48eb-b100-27b696ef407d.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.</span><span>勾选同意后，点击“前往钉钉</span><span>APP</span><span>登录”后，通过“立即登录”，根据个人习惯设置应用锁后，开启手机端</span><span>VPN</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/a4528bca-4fe1-411e-933e-b1dd4dcba6e0.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/22532622-5b50-4125-bb08-92ee66f34109.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/5d9ce41f-a8fc-4c96-9750-93dc17cd6e03.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>4.</span><span>隧道访问开启后，最小化</span><span>VPN</span><span>界面后，可通过“钉钉”使用学校系统。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/d4bc1624-5772-4451-bf3a-0d7d6d31a0a1.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong><span>（二）</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>IOS</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>版：</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>请从手机应用市场下载安装“</span><span>aTrust”</span><span>客户端，运行客户端“</span><span>aTrust”</span><span>，点击“无线局域网与蜂窝网络”。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/cbda1d0c-980d-4309-a6ef-95190cf114b5.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>2.</span><span>请在地址栏请输入：</span><span>https://atrust.swust.edu.cn</span><span>后点击“连接”。若无法连接服务器，请打开手机飞行模式，等待</span><span>3</span><span>秒，再关闭飞行模式后，尝试再次连接。如果仍然失败，可以多次尝试以上操作。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/1b6a7d83-d4d1-4bc9-90dc-cd43441ce035.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>3.</span><span>截图手机上出现的二维码到个人相册，立刻通过钉钉扫码选择手机相册中该二维码，点击“登陆网页版零信任平台”后，迅速切换回 atrust 应用。（如果登陆失败，请重复该步骤）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/fb0d16f9-faca-4b64-acda-b852fe9b27cd.png\"/></p><p><span>4.</span><span>在手机出现的二维码登录界面中点击“登录网页版零信任平台”，根据个人习惯设置应用锁。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>在“</span><span>aTrust”</span><span>想添加</span><span>VPN</span><span>配置弹窗中选择“允许”后，开启手机端</span><span>VPN</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/2be737e4-62cc-4496-9210-12c87dce3863.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>6.</span><span>隧道访问开启后，最小化</span><span>VPN</span><span>界面后，可通过“钉钉”使用学校应用系统。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/d4bc1624-5772-4451-bf3a-0d7d6d31a0a1.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>（三）</span><strong><span>鸿蒙</span></strong><strong><span>版：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>   <span>温馨提示：华为手机鸿蒙系统可能会出现成功登录</span></span><span>atrust</span><span>，但点击业务系统跳转到浏览器后仍然提示“请安装零信任客户端后访问！”。</span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/cf2a746c-8917-4a4a-b766-551dd1d1f1df.png\"/><span> </span></p><p><span><span> <span>  请在手机设置中点击</span></span><span>“应用和元服务”，在应用中找到</span><span>atrust</span><span>后点击进入，打开“跨应用关联”按钮。</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/d9c6fcce-7596-4669-823d-0b2b01f23af9.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>三、如何卸载</span></strong><strong><span>aTrust</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>（一）电脑端：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>如下图所示，在徽标键上点击右键，选择“应用和功能”。</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/ffeaf560-e603-4142-9d1f-4bc0ccab2fc7.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>如下图所示，选择</span></span><span>aTrust</span><span><span>，点击</span><span>“卸载”。</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/87182424-df2e-4fd2-839c-6a7ed07591bd.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>（二）手机端：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>如下图所示，长按</span><span>aTrust</span><span>图标，在弹出的对话框上选择“卸载”即可。</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/b3ca1d96-8887-43e5-b936-0a25f451b916.png\"/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span><span>第二部分：学术资源访问说明</span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>方式</span><span>1.</span></strong><span><span>登录</span><span>“</span><span>atrust</span><span>”客户端后，直接点击“图书馆主页”进入学校图书馆资源库主页；点击你需要访问的资源库进入学校统一身份认证后，即可进行访问。</span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/0eeda993-a60d-4924-8cc9-2dae7514338e.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/edcebe13-0a91-4c0d-a98a-1251b60a1d28.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/89e70e1f-0c47-4a88-8f13-3ee6ae3a3cb3.png\"/></p><p><span> </span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/47c9f3b2-f7ca-499b-ba82-5caab0c3a2fd.png\"/></p><p><span></span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>方式</span><span>2.</span></strong><span><span>登录</span><span>“</span><span>atrust</span><span>”客户端，经过统一身份认证进入“网上服务大厅”后，点击“数字文献资源”进入学校数据库导航界面即可访问学校购置的学术资源。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/c83e5f19-15db-45ce-b619-dd4d2e3e4dc8.png\"/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://its.swust.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e4/2e/80f3386845f38327f042c0e3ac99/8c78f7b2-1280-4e09-8330-968276fb1396.png\"/></p><p><span></span><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><div><p><br/></p></div></div>","textSha256":"9d8b674335170b3c5b1dc3ae4bf922e1be8ff75ea06d23df56733e57a691d7b3","textLength":1361,"sourceSha256":"729eeb981440d78e34314c68306d54d125a130a3db49900b1de8e87bccc4f897","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-52c23356cbfd9209bf86","title":"2026年西南科技大学文学与艺术学院2027年免试攻读研究生接收工作细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:55.176186+00:00"}
